lf maid, and the empress who is a little girl. He comes up with the idea of building a school. At first it runs as a comedy but later there are serious matters that Shinichi needs to face: ethnic discrimination, social problems, conflict with neighboring countries, sabotage by opposition elements including Japanese government, etc. Can he overcome the obstacles, successfully bring \"moe\" culture to the fantasy world, and help the people there as well?"},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Teacher","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Language Barrier","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":62,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":58,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Elf","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Military","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":43,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Video Games","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":33,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Disability","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":23,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reverse Isekai","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":15,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Outbreak Company","english":"Outbreak Company","native":"アウトブレイク・カンパニー","romaji":"Outbreak Company","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"萌萌侵略者"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"萌える侵略者"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"萌之侵略者"}]},"trailer":{"id":"8D5_c-s2BLk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8D5_c-s2BLk/hqdefault.jpg"